BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 696.0 Tm (KWL-NEXUS) Tj /F2 20 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 674.0 Tm (App Integration Guide \(for new app developers\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 644.0 Tm (Connect reports, tutorials, catalog and plans. Version 1.0.) Tj /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 618.0 Tm (1. Connect your app in 4 steps) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 592.0 Tm (Step 1 - Ask the Nexus admin for two things: \(a\) an API key) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 577.0 Tm (\(starts with kn_live_\) and \(b\) your appId \(Mongo ObjectId\).) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 556.0 Tm (Step 2 - Send the key on every request in the x-api-key header.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 535.0 Tm (Step 3 - Implement Reports \(section 3\) so users can send feedback.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 514.0 Tm (Step 4 - Implement Help/Tutorial \(section 4\) using cached content.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 493.0 Tm (Base URL is your Nexus domain, e.g. https://kwl-nexus.onrender.com) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 478.0 Tm (Keep the API key secret: ship it as a build secret, never in chat.) Tj /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 467.0 Tm (2. Authentication and limits) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 441.0 Tm (Header: x-api-key: kn_live_...  \(Authorization: Bearer also works\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 420.0 Tm (Rate limit: 1000 requests per hour per key \(shared by all installs\).) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 399.0 Tm (401 = missing/invalid/revoked key. 429 = slow down and retry later.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 378.0 Tm (404 on /apps/<id>/... usually means a wrong appId or unpublished app.) Tj /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 367.0 Tm (3. Reports API - POST /api/feedback) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 341.0 Tm (Send user reports \(errors, suggestions, feature requests, ratings\).) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 320.0 Tm (Required: appId, type, title \(3-160 chars\), description \(5-5000\).) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 305.0 Tm (type is one of: bug_report | suggestion | feature_request | rating) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 290.0 Tm (Optional: link \(problem URL, max 2000\), contactEmail, rating 1-5,) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 275.0 Tm (screenshot \(base64/text, max about 1.5MB\).) Tj /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 254.0 Tm (Example: {"appId":"<ObjectId>","type":"bug_report",) Tj /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 240.0 Tm ("title":"Crash on export","description":"Steps: ...",) Tj /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 226.0 Tm ("link":"https://...","contactEmail":"user@mail.com"}) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 205.0 Tm (201 returns { data: { id, status } }. Anything else: queue locally) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 190.0 Tm (and retry later - never lose a user report.) Tj /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 179.0 Tm (4. Tutorial API - GET /api/apps/<id>/tutorial) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 153.0 Tm (Public endpoint \(no key needed\). Powers the in-app Help view.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 132.0 Tm (Response data: title, description, videoUrl/videoType \(optional\),) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 117.0 Tm (sections: [{ heading, bodyMarkdown }] \(optional\), appName, appSlug.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 96.0 Tm (Cache the response on device and show the cached copy offline.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 81.0 Tm (Refresh in background when online. 404 = no tutorial published yet.) Tj /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 36 Tm (Page 1 of 2) Tj ET
endstream
